    {
      "platform": "windows",
      "version": "7.5.0",
      "release_date": "2026-10-29",
      "release_notes": "- OTP (desktop): Add keyboard layout families and variants for static passwords.\n- PIV: Remove support for legacy PIN-derived management keys. PIN-protected stored management keys remain supported.\n- PIV: Add support for ML-DSA and ML-KEM keys on PQC YubiKeys.\n- Android: Add support for configuring OTP slots.\n- Desktop: Replace the Python helper with a Rust-based helper using YubiKey Manager 6.0.0-beta.0.\n- Desktop: Unify USB and NFC device handling and device selection.\n- Windows: Add native ARM64 support.\n- Windows: Add a background service for YubiKey access removing the need to elevate to Administrator for FIDO commands.\n- UI: Updated app icons, typography and color scheme.\n- Temporarily cached FIDO, PIV and OATH credentials now expire after three minutes of inactivity.\n- macOS: Raise the minimum supported version to 12.0 (Monterey) to follow Flutter's deployment target requirements.\n- Binaries compiled with Flutter 3.47.8.",
      "release_notes_url": "https://github.com/Yubico/yubioath-flutter/releases/tag/7.5.0",
